{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我们分手吧？老实说我受不了了。”", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4097", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是不是受不了，不继续下去不知道。”", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就说受不了了，这种事！在彼此的伤口加深前分开比较好。”", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4098", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一转眼就即将破局的我们。", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "话虽如此，并不是关系变差了。", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……新吾真的喜欢我？”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4099", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“当然喜欢了。”", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪呢？”", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我、我也……喜欢啦……”", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4100", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4101", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪看着我一会，然后垂下视线。", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天从早上就一直是这样。", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "微妙的距离感。", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比告白之前更远。", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“昨天，在那之后。”", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4102", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。”", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我回家后试着练习了，练到很晚。”", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4103", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“练习？练什么？”", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……像、像个女朋友对新吾撒娇的方法。”", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4104", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“毕竟都开始交往了……我就想说……也要注意那种事情……”", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4105", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是从刚才开始感觉距离就好遥远。”", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因、因为一靠近你、就说不好话……”", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4106", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我不知道女朋友要做什么才好。”", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4107", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪强烈地意识到恋人这层身份。", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也是。", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "交往后，我们之间的气氛就变了。", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不知道怎样的相处模式才是“恋人该有的”。", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……果然还是分手比较好。”", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4108", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪背对我，是我无法摸到她头的距离。", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在告白前做得那么自然的事情，现在却害羞到不行。", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这样的变化让我们都很困惑。", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“现在想起来，我们在交往前就做很多羞耻的事情了吧？”", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4109", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“牵手、摸头、摸肚子、公主抱……”", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4110", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪越说脸越红，连耳朵都红了。", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我太不知羞耻了。”", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4111", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "接着开始情绪低落，我不知道该怎么回应她。", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是我不想因为那种理由分手。”", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我、我也是啊！”", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4112", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是现在根本没办法直视新吾的脸，也不可能像个女朋友般撒娇……”", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4113", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“既然会变成这样，不如回到交往前还比较好……”", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4114", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪因为我而苦恼着。", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这让我感到高兴，同时也痛苦。", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我觉得能对你传达自己的心意太好了。”", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“！？”", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4115", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我不想回到交往前。因为我已经没必要糊弄自己了。”", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我一靠近她，纱凪就抖了一下抬起眼眸看我。", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……像我这样的也可以吗？”", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4116", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就算当女朋友也绝对不可爱喔。嘴巴很坏、性格又糟糕、气质跟身材都……”", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4117", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不是像你这样的可不可以。”", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而是对我来说不是纱凪就不行。”", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“笨、笨蛋！那么羞耻的话、一脸正经、而且距离这么近地说……”", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4118", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看着纱凪越来越红的脸，我心里涌出一股怜爱之意。", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我、我先说清楚喔！我也！”", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4119", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……啊，还是算了。”", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4120", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么？我想听你说。”", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4121", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也、那个……只有、对新吾……”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4122", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊不行了、脸好热！在说什么啊我！笨蛋笨蛋笨蛋……！”", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4123", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔唔，这种状态下周末结束后绝对会很糟糕！明明在教室里要一直面对新吾……”", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4124", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对大家保密比较好吗？”", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎、怎么可能说得出口嘛！”", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4125", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“之前动不动就在教室里骂你渣虫，现在却喜欢上……”", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4126", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还有，绝对会被其他女生问‘新吾怎么样？’的……”", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4127", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……也就是说，目前维持秘密的关系？”", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“秘密是秘密没错……但也需要理解者。”", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4128", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“理解者？”", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对，让能信任的人成为伙伴。”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4129", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“知道我喜欢新吾，而且能商量事情的人……”", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4130", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也想到了一个能当伙伴的人。", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪心中也有了人选。", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理。”", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4131", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“隼太。”", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯嗯？椋梨知道我们的事情吗？”", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4132", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是说，濑名同学知道了？”", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们对彼此点点头，然后做出了决定。", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果是这样──”", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4133", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你们突然跑来，我还以为发生什么事了……”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": "_ht1733", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“居然说叫我们当你们的伙伴……”", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 381, "voice": "_ar6564", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "星期六学校放假。", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是我找到了因为学生会的工作而来学校的隼太。", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之新吾，你跟小乾开始交往了？”", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": "_ht1734", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对。”", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪，他这样说没有错吧？”", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 381, "voice": "_ar6565", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没有错。”", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4134", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "隼太／爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "_ar6566", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "他们对视一眼，表情有些无奈。", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪与我隔了一段距离，一段不会让自己脸红的距离。", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……濑名同学，你怎么想这两个人？”", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": "_ht1736", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎、怎么想……真的交往了吗？可是离得这么远很不自然……”", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 381, "voice": "_ar6567", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾稍微靠近小乾一点吧？”", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": "_ht1737", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这其实有很多原因。”", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……有很多原因。”", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4135", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这种时候的纱凪很老实。", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 381, "voice": "_ar6568", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我知道你们想对班上的人保密，可是这太难了吧？”", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 381, "voice": "_ar6569", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对啊。”", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": "_ht1738", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为什么？我们平常又没有黏在一起亲热，连爱理你也对我们交往觉得很不可思议不是吗？”", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4136", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是没错，可是看到你们的眼神就知道了。”", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 381, "voice": "_ar6570", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“眼神？”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4137", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们对视一眼，然后再次看向濑名同学。", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪的眼睛在说她好喜欢好喜欢瓜生君。”", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 381, "voice": "_ar6571", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾也用很疼爱的目光凝视小乾。”", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": "_ht1739", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被点出意料之外的事实，我们又对视一眼。", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "光是这样纱凪就脸红了。", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这要怎么办才好……”", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": "_ht1740", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我已经能预料到大家知道纱凪跟男生交往后，会引发怎样的骚动……”", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 381, "voice": "_ar6572", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“毕竟是那个小乾嘛……”", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": "_ht1741", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪在班上是讨厌男人出名的。”", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 381, "voice": "_ar6573", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……因为就喜欢上了嘛。”", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4138", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“看吧，就叫你不要用那种眼神看瓜生君了。”", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 381, "voice": "_ar6574", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾从刚才开始就一直眯着眼充满疼爱地注视。”", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": "_ht1742", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就算他们这么说，我也无法克制。", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我喜欢新吾的心情就这么明显吗？”", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4139", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“从旁边看起来，就是多谢招待的感觉。”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 381, "voice": "_ar6575", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“隼太，我呢？”", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这个嘛……我很清楚你对小乾的溺爱了。”", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": "_ht1743", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没办法否定，只好沉默。", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之如果想要隐瞒的话，在星期一前要掩饰好才行喔。”", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 381, "voice": "_ar6576", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没错没错，最后是你们自己要努力。”", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": "_ht1744", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯。”", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4140", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "于是我们又不自觉看向彼此。", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我决定了。暂时就用瓜生来叫新吾。”", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4141", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾也……不对，瓜生也叫我的姓氏吧？”", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4142", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“在教室里也这样叫吗？”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“当然。这样一来就显得生疏，连爱理他们也会惊讶。”", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4143", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然我觉得事情发展的方向不太对，不过现在已经无法阻止纱凪了。", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然交往第一天就差点分手，不过我会加油。”", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4144", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而且经过一天，应该也会稍微冷静下来。”", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 384, "voice": "_sn4145", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，确实有可能呢。”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 376, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "或许是因为彼此都是第一次跟人交往，所以情绪比较高亢。", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "时间久了应该就能恢复成从前那样自然相处。", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我是这么想的。", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
